طبق این ویدیو وارد WhiteVPN بشید، برید به قسمت تنظیمات، قسمت و بخش اتصال ها و سپس گزینه Fragment(تکه‌تکه سازی) رو فعال کنید

در بخش FinalMask مقادیر زیر رو تست کنید

#1

{"tcp": [{"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "tlshello", "lengths": ["10-15"], "delays": ["0"], "maxSplit": "0"}}, {"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "1-2", "lengths": ["6-12"], "delays": ["1"], "maxSplit": "0"}}]}

#2

{"tcp": [{"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "tlshello", "lengths": ["12-24"], "delays": ["0"], "maxSplit": "0"}}, {"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "1-2", "lengths": ["8-16"], "delays": ["1-2"], "maxSplit": "0"}}]}

#3

{"tcp": [{"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "tlshello", "lengths": ["18-33"], "delays": ["0"], "maxSplit": "0"}}, {"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "1-3", "lengths": ["9-16"], "delays": ["1-2"], "maxSplit": "0"}}]}

#4

{"tcp": [{"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "tlshello", "lengths": ["16-32"], "delays": ["0"], "maxSplit": "0"}}, {"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "1-6", "lengths": ["4-8"], "delays": ["2-4"], "maxSplit": "0"}}]}

#5

{"tcp": [{"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "tlshello", "lengths": ["15-30"], "delays": ["0"], "maxSplit": "0"}}, {"type": "fragment", "settings": {"packets": "1-2", "lengths": ["10-20"], "delays": ["1-2"], "maxSplit": "0"}}]}


سپس دکمه اتصال رو بزنید و یکم صبر کنید

@LabAlan
